arty-smart — third-party notices
================================

Parts of this crate are ported from katgpt-rs
(https://github.com/katopz/katgpt-rs, branch `develop`, commit
3facb6607cbac4431f8a976d56cf37ffd61668d3, ported 2026-10-05), which is
distributed under the MIT License reproduced below. Every ported file starts
with a "Ported from katgpt-rs <path> (MIT)" line naming its source file(s)
and what was changed. ARTY does not depend on any katgpt crate; the code was
copied and adapted (MSRV 1.88, no SIMD/unsafe, allocation-free APIs, LLM- and
game-specific parts removed).

